	(text "Gain 11 x 11 = 121. Firmware holds GP2 high-Z with its input buffer OFF while receiving (RP2350-E9), so R1 does not load or bias the pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7000 172.7200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d5528dcf-0e49-4d2c-bc57-ee7b084a787a")
	)
	(text "Every JP ships OPEN: bridge with solder to bring the board up one stage at a time (README order); wick off to isolate. No test pad on the 10 MOhm node on purpose."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7000 175.2600 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "03a43ee8-deca-43f4-93b3-b7481bf9bc00")
	)
	(text "JP3: centre -> R9. Blob to pin 3 = stage 2 (x121); move it to pin 1 = stage 1 only (x11) if stage 2 clips. C6 is DNP: fit it instead of bridging JP2 to AC-couple TX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7000 177.8000 0)
		(effects
